  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "獨立研究(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INDEPENDENT STUDY(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生在指導教授的指導下，進行其研究性或實務性論文的主題探討，並進行相關文獻與資料的搜集與閱讀，從而使學生得以對其所欲撰寫之論文主題與方向，獲得清楚的認識並能開始進行畢業論文的撰寫。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will provide students to explore the subject or looking for data about their master’s thesis under the directing of their supervisors. Let the students could learn how to chose a subject, which they can handle and conduct well. In order to help student could submit their master’s thesis on time.",
